<view class="page binding-page"><member-brand/><view class="binding-card"><view class="binding-title">首次会员身份验证</view><view class="binding-copy">{{message}}</view><view class="binding-steps"><view>1. 微信登录仅验证当前小程序 OpenID</view><view>2. 手机号仅在你主动授权后由服务端核验</view><view>3. 唯一且有效的 CRM 匹配会自动绑定</view><view>4. 无匹配、多匹配、退群、过期或冲突转人工处理</view></view><view class="notice">不会读取微信昵称、微信号或微信群成员状态；不会向会员端返回 CRM、手机号或内部匹配信息。</view><button wx:if="{{state==='intro'||state==='disabled'}}" class="button" bindtap="begin">开始验证</button><button wx:if="{{state==='phone_consent'}}" class="button" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="authorizePhone">授权手机号并匹配</button><button wx:if="{{state==='phone_consent'}}" class="button button-secondary" bindtap="continueManual">不授权，转人工核验</button><view wx:if="{{state==='login_pending'||state==='matching'||state==='session_pending'}}" class="binding-progress">处理中，请稍候…</view><view wx:if="{{state==='manual_review'&&reviewReasons.length}}" class="reason-list"><view wx:for="{{reviewReasons}}" wx:key="*this">核验项：{{item}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{state==='error'}}" class="button button-secondary" bindtap="retry">重新尝试</button></view></view>
